\f1\fs22 Or in the case of Fridge Force, shaping the future.\
In the very early days of Fridge Force, they looked upon the New Ulyssian Market Bible\'97especially the book of Exploitations and the emails of the Nine Major Saints of Latter Day Capitalism\'97and were catholically inspired to ordain a new Stasis Weapons Division.\
And the shareholders rejoiced, for they had demanded that there be diversity in the activities of the firm. They saw how stasis technology was used to preserve things, and proclaimed that the balance sheet should show equal profit from blowing shit up till the end of days.\
As it turned out, those shareholders got exactly what they asked for.
